<h1>
	Starpoint Software Regulatory Licensing Program
</h1>
<p>
	Starpoint Software will provide a complimentary single user license of any software product
	to regulatory agencies at the request of a regulated entity only.  Use of complimentary
	software is restricted to reviewing data supplied by the regulated entity only.
</p>
<p>
	For any other use, regulatory agencies must purchase all software at
	retail prices and are subject to the same licensing restrictions as all other customers.
</p>
